  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "1上"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "現代\n2:48 P.M.  天氣/晴\n薩爾貢中部，伊巴特地區，無名城鎮"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暴雨",
      "speakerToken": "char_304_hvrain",
      "operatorId": "char_304_hvrain",
      "portraitKey": "char_304_hvrain",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暴雨",
      "speakerToken": "char_304_hvrain",
      "operatorId": "char_304_hvrain",
      "portraitKey": "char_304_hvrain",
      "text": "沒有人。（......還是沒見到人影，他們不會有事吧......？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "懾砂",
      "speakerToken": "char_379_sesa_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_379_sesa",
      "portraitKey": "char_379_sesa",
      "text": "怪了，說好的接頭地點就是這裡吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暴雨",
      "speakerToken": "char_304_hvrain",
      "operatorId": "char_304_hvrain",
      "portraitKey": "char_304_hvrain",
      "text": "座標沒錯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "懾砂",
      "speakerToken": "char_379_sesa_1",
      "operatorId": "char_379_sesa",
      "portraitKey": "char_379_sesa",
      "text": "說不準是遇到沙塵暴耽擱了吧，不著急。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暴雨",
      "speakerToken": "char_304_hvrain#4",
      "operatorId": "char_304_hvrain",
      "portraitKey": "char_304_hvrain",
      "text": "懾砂......這樣不太好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "懾砂",
      "speakerToken": "char_379_sesa_1",
      "operatorId": "char_379_sesa",
      "portraitKey": "char_379_sesa",
      "text": "哎，接頭的人還沒來，我們這麼嚴肅幹嘛，大眼瞪小眼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暴雨",
      "speakerToken": "char_304_hvrain#4",
      "operatorId": "char_304_hvrain",
      "portraitKey": "char_304_hvrain",
      "text": "......那也不要玩遊戲機。你怎麼帶來的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "懾砂",
      "speakerToken": "char_379_sesa_1",
      "operatorId": "char_379_sesa",
      "portraitKey": "char_379_sesa",
      "text": "無所謂啦——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暴雨",
      "speakerToken": "char_304_hvrain",
      "operatorId": "char_304_hvrain",
      "portraitKey": "char_304_hvrain",
      "text": "......也許情況不對。至少該有一次定時聯絡的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "懾砂",
      "speakerToken": "char_379_sesa_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_379_sesa",
      "portraitKey": "char_379_sesa",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暴雨",
      "speakerToken": "char_304_hvrain#4",
      "operatorId": "char_304_hvrain",
      "portraitKey": "char_304_hvrain",
      "text": "......我們是不是該做點什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "懾砂",
      "speakerToken": "char_379_sesa_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_379_sesa",
      "portraitKey": "char_379_sesa",
      "text": "別這麼著急，我們能做什麼呢？最好的辦法就是好好在這裡待著，等待回音。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暴雨",
      "speakerToken": "char_304_hvrain#3",
      "operatorId": "char_304_hvrain",
      "portraitKey": "char_304_hvrain",
      "text": "但......這太久了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暴雨",
      "speakerToken": "char_304_hvrain#2",
      "operatorId": "char_304_hvrain",
      "portraitKey": "char_304_hvrain",
      "text": "等等，有——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_172_1#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（薩爾貢語）早安，二位。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "懾砂",
      "speakerToken": "char_379_sesa_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_379_sesa",
      "portraitKey": "char_379_sesa",
      "text": "暴雨！慢著！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暴雨",
      "speakerToken": "char_304_hvrain#4",
      "operatorId": "char_304_hvrain",
      "portraitKey": "char_304_hvrain",
      "text": "唔——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暴雨",
      "speakerToken": "char_304_hvrain#3",
      "operatorId": "char_304_hvrain",
      "portraitKey": "char_304_hvrain",
      "text": "抱、抱歉，下意識就攻擊了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_172_1#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（薩爾貢語）喔，與外表不同，真是一位激動的小姐，可這樣只會毀壞大家的第一印象......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_172_1#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（薩爾貢語）這裡是沁礁黑市，大家都是生意人。我相信我們有話可說，不必兵戈相向吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "懾砂",
      "speakerToken": "char_379_sesa_1",
      "operatorId": "char_379_sesa",
      "portraitKey": "char_379_sesa",
      "text": "（薩爾貢語）今天是什麼日子？“沙卒”怎麼會在這裡？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“沙卒”",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_172_1#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（薩爾貢語）唔，你認得我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "懾砂",
      "speakerToken": "char_379_sesa_1",
      "operatorId": "char_379_sesa",
      "portraitKey": "char_379_sesa",
      "text": "（薩爾貢語）沁礁黑市的頭號情報販子，伊巴特絕大部分武裝衝突的幕後黑手，當地人稱他為“祖祖”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "懾砂",
      "speakerToken": "char_379_sesa_1",
      "operatorId": "char_379_sesa",
      "portraitKey": "char_379_sesa",
      "text": "（薩爾貢語）在古老的語言裡，是符咒，或者護身符的意思——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "懾砂",
      "speakerToken": "char_379_sesa_1",
      "operatorId": "char_379_sesa",
      "portraitKey": "char_379_sesa",
      "text": "（薩爾貢語）——但我知道你的公開代號是什麼，“沙卒”，你可是個大人物，來這裡想做什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“沙卒”",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_172_1#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（薩爾貢語）別這麼說，我只是想和二位談談。和......嗯，羅德島談談。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“沙卒”",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_172_1#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（薩爾貢語）還是說......我打擾了各位原本的行程？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暴雨",
      "speakerToken": "char_304_hvrain#2",
      "operatorId": "char_304_hvrain",
      "portraitKey": "char_304_hvrain",
      "text": "......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暴雨",
      "speakerToken": "char_304_hvrain#4",
      "operatorId": "char_304_hvrain",
      "portraitKey": "char_304_hvrain",
      "text": "（薩爾貢語）......我們的幹員在哪裡？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“沙卒”",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_172_1#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哦......原來這位小姐也是薩爾貢人，不錯，那我們就開門見山吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“沙卒”",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_172_1#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你們的幹員平安無事。你們的那批實驗性藥物材料......也紋絲未動。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暴雨",
      "speakerToken": "char_304_hvrain#4",
      "operatorId": "char_304_hvrain",
      "portraitKey": "char_304_hvrain",
      "text": "......他們在哪裡？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“沙卒”",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_172_1#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......誰知道呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暴雨",
      "speakerToken": "char_304_hvrain#4",
      "operatorId": "char_304_hvrain",
      "portraitKey": "char_304_hvrain",
      "text": "你——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "懾砂",
      "speakerToken": "char_379_sesa_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_379_sesa",
      "portraitKey": "char_379_sesa",
      "text": "暴雨，別激動！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“沙卒”",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_172_1#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "說得對，別激動，你們還沒有在這裡與我發生衝突的資本。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“沙卒”",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_172_1#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "比起那批價格不菲的藥物原料，幾個來路不明的搬運工對我來說可沒什麼價值......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暴雨",
      "speakerToken": "char_304_hvrain",
      "operatorId": "char_304_hvrain",
      "portraitKey": "char_304_hvrain",
      "text": "你盯上了那批原料。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“沙卒”",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_172_1#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......如果我點頭了呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暴雨",
      "speakerToken": "char_304_hvrain",
      "operatorId": "char_304_hvrain",
      "portraitKey": "char_304_hvrain",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "懾砂",
      "speakerToken": "char_379_sesa_1",
      "operatorId": "char_379_sesa",
      "portraitKey": "char_379_sesa",
      "text": "把我們的幹員放走，貨物都歸你，如何？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“沙卒”",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_172_1#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唔，這麼乾脆？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“沙卒”",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_172_1#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不過是挾持了幾個雇員而已......這我倒有些懷疑了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“沙卒”",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_172_1#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "雖然那批貨數量不多，但價格可不算便宜。“羅德島製藥”似乎不是什麼財大氣粗的企業，你們真會這麼心甘情願地放手？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "懾砂",
      "speakerToken": "char_379_sesa_1",
      "operatorId": "char_379_sesa",
      "portraitKey": "char_379_sesa",
      "text": "別這麼說，行情不同，人命在我們這可是最珍貴的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“沙卒”",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_172_1#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "充滿人文關懷的想法，但是誰來負責給他們權衡定價？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“沙卒”",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_172_1#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那位“凱爾希”嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暴雨",
      "speakerToken": "char_304_hvrain#2",
      "operatorId": "char_304_hvrain",
      "portraitKey": "char_304_hvrain",
      "text": "......你劫持了我們的合約......你知道凱爾希醫生？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“沙卒”",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_172_1#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不，叫這個名字的人並不少，這麼些年，我已經找錯很多個人了......很多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "懾砂",
      "speakerToken": "char_379_sesa_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_379_sesa",
      "portraitKey": "char_379_sesa",
      "text": "回到剛才的話題上來吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“沙卒”",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_172_1#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哦，失禮了，其實你們的人就在門外等著，而你們的貨我也完全不感興趣——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "懾砂",
      "speakerToken": "char_379_sesa_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_379_sesa",
      "portraitKey": "char_379_sesa",
      "text": "——暴雨。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暴雨",
      "speakerToken": "char_304_hvrain",
      "operatorId": "char_304_hvrain",
      "portraitKey": "char_304_hvrain",
      "text": "......我這就出去看看——你小心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“沙卒”",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_172_1#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "請便。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "懾砂",
      "speakerToken": "char_379_sesa_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_379_sesa",
      "portraitKey": "char_379_sesa",
      "text": "唔，黑市的當家......總不能只是來嚇唬嚇唬我們這些新手的吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "懾砂",
      "speakerToken": "char_379_sesa_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_379_sesa",
      "portraitKey": "char_379_sesa",
      "text": "羅德島與薩爾貢黑市的關係並不密切，我們只是為了取得一些被哥倫比亞卡住的醫療實驗材料才不得不鋌而走險。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "懾砂",
      "speakerToken": "char_379_sesa_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_379_sesa",
      "portraitKey": "char_379_sesa",
      "text": "礦石病不等人，對吧，僅此而已，我們應該沒有什麼衝突吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“沙卒”",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_172_1#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我聽說過你，武器調整師“橋”，你為三家地下軍火商效勞過，口碑都不錯。哦，現在，你是叫“懾砂”了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "懾砂",
      "speakerToken": "char_379_sesa_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_379_sesa",
      "portraitKey": "char_379_sesa",
      "text": "過獎過獎。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "懾砂",
      "speakerToken": "char_379_sesa_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_379_sesa",
      "portraitKey": "char_379_sesa",
      "text": "......那麼，你是怎麼盯上羅德島的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“沙卒”",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_172_1#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "只是在例行盤查帳目的時候發現了一筆滴水不漏的交易，你知道，在沁礁傳遞的每一枚金幣都經手我的耳目。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "懾砂",
      "speakerToken": "char_379_sesa_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_379_sesa",
      "portraitKey": "char_379_sesa",
      "text": "......所以呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“沙卒”",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_172_1#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不，別緊張，你們沒有露出任何把柄，而且我也說了，我對這筆交易也不感興趣。我只是對這份合約上的......簽名，相當在意。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“沙卒”",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_172_1#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "來吧，今天我有的是時間。告訴我，羅德島製藥，是個什麼樣的地方？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "二十二年前"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
