      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "機械......不，生物！？你到底是什麼玩意！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "搜索中的雇傭兵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_007",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "別過來——為什麼弩箭射不穿——別過來啊！你過來我就殺了他！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
      "speakerToken": "npc_10002",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（譏笑）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "眼前的怪物在少年的面前刺穿了歹徒。\n它輕輕地舒展著軀體，如同清晨時分的懶腰。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "神秘的女性",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kaltsn07_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kaltsn07",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kaltsn07",
      "text": "......Mon3tr。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
      "speakerToken": "npc_10002",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（回應）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_171_1#10",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啊......啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "少年動彈不得，也早已哭不出聲。\n他只是抱著一具冰涼的屍體，死者的血液凝結在他的胸前，像朵花。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "神秘的女性",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kaltsn07_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kaltsn07",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kaltsn07",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "神秘的女性",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kaltsn07_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kaltsn07",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kaltsn07",
      "text": "艾利奧特，你安全了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾利奧特",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_171_1#10",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾利奧特",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_171_1#10",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你、你是誰......你認得我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "神秘的女性",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kaltsn07_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kaltsn07",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kaltsn07",
      "text": "我認識布萊恩創生科技研究所的每一位可敬的科學家。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "神秘的女性",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kaltsn07_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kaltsn07",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kaltsn07",
      "text": "但你們並不知道這件事被捲入了怎樣的陰謀，我來阻止你們，也來保護你們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾利奧特",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_171_1#11",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "保護......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾利奧特",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_171_1#11",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "已經遲了......早就遲了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "神秘的女性",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kaltsn07_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kaltsn07",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kaltsn07",
      "text": "你沒有讓你恩師的遺產落入那些陰謀家的手裡，你做得夠好了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾利奧特",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_171_1#11",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾利奧特",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_171_1#11",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "說什麼保護......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾利奧特",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_171_1#10",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "——你要保護的是這個！這份圖紙，這份樣本，不是我！也不是老師！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾利奧特",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_171_1#10",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你和那些人沒什麼區別！老師死了！那些幫助我們的人也死了！你們都只是衝著這個箱子，你們、你們——咳咳、咳——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "神秘的女性",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kaltsn07_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kaltsn07",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kaltsn07",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "通訊裡的聲音",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "顧問，確認了三支受雇於各地王酋的雇傭兵隊伍，以及一支蟄伏在鎮外峭壁上的薩卡茲部隊，暫時不明所屬。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "通訊裡的聲音",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "按計畫，我們還有七分鐘。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "神秘的女性",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kaltsn07_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kaltsn07",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kaltsn07",
      "text": "......我找到了一名倖存者，樣本在他的手上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "通訊裡的聲音",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "撤退路線安全。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "神秘的女性",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kaltsn07_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kaltsn07",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kaltsn07",
      "text": "三分鐘後會合。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾利奧特",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_171_1#11",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "神秘的女性",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kaltsn07_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kaltsn07",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kaltsn07",
      "text": "告訴我，艾利奧特，你現在背著的那位瓦伊凡戰士，他為何而死？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾利奧特",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_171_1#11",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......住口......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "神秘的女性",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kaltsn07_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kaltsn07",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kaltsn07",
      "text": "現在，你站在這裡，你活著，你帶著這裡每一個雇傭兵都想要的東西。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "神秘的女性",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kaltsn07_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kaltsn07",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kaltsn07",
      "text": "小隊的行動代號是“沙卒”......但實際上來到薩爾貢的，只是科研團隊和一支來自提卡倫多的常規安保力量而已。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "神秘的女性",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kaltsn07_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kaltsn07",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kaltsn07",
      "text": "他是否到最後一刻都沒有放棄職責，是否最後一刻都在為你的安危著想，將重任委託於你？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "神秘的女性",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kaltsn07_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kaltsn07",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kaltsn07",
      "text": "你是否要因為你自己不成熟的性格問題，讓戰士們的努力全部白費？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "神秘的女性",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kaltsn07_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kaltsn07",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kaltsn07",
      "text": "我只需要一個回答。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "神秘的女性",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kaltsn07_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kaltsn07",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kaltsn07",
      "text": "只要能確認這份原型圖紙不落入任何一位王酋的手裡，其他的事情，我大可不去在意，希望你能想明白這點。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾利奧特",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_171_1#11",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "神秘的女性",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kaltsn07_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kaltsn07",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kaltsn07",
      "text": "很警覺，你依舊不願意多說什麼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "神秘的女性",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kaltsn07_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kaltsn07",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kaltsn07",
      "text": "但我想起來了......你背著的那位男性，是教授索恩。布萊恩創生科技研究所的首席研究員。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "神秘的女性",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kaltsn07_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kaltsn07",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kaltsn07",
      "text": "他並不是個真正的戰士。卻也算是個真正的戰士。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾利奧特",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_171_1#11",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "神秘的女性",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kaltsn07_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kaltsn07",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kaltsn07",
      "text": "放下他吧。或者你會陪他一同埋葬在黃沙中。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "神秘的女性",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kaltsn07_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kaltsn07",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kaltsn07",
      "text": "我相信他自認為死得其所，而你不應當白費了他的犧牲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾利奧特",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_171_1#11",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "神秘的女性",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kaltsn07_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kaltsn07",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kaltsn07",
      "text": "他已經死了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾利奧特",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_171_1#10",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不！不用你管！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "神秘的女性",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kaltsn07_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kaltsn07",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kaltsn07",
      "text": "至少體面地埋葬他吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "神秘的女性",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kaltsn07_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kaltsn07",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kaltsn07",
      "text": "......Mon3tr。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
      "speakerToken": "npc_10002",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（嘶鳴）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾利奧特",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_171_1#11",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那、那個光球是什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "神秘的女性",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kaltsn07_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kaltsn07",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kaltsn07",
      "text": "低下頭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾利奧特",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_171_1#11",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唔——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾利奧特",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_171_1#11",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......你......你是要我把老師埋葬在這裡？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "神秘的女性",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kaltsn07_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kaltsn07",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kaltsn07",
      "text": "索恩教授和我是舊識，情況特殊，我們沒法更加鄭重地面對他的犧牲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "神秘的女性",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kaltsn07_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kaltsn07",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kaltsn07",
      "text": "每個人的生命都是一場漫長的爭鬥。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "神秘的女性",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kaltsn07_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kaltsn07",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kaltsn07",
      "text": "他的先祖因為某些原因離開了薩爾貢，幾經流轉，他找到了屬於自己的人生，卻最終回到了薩爾貢的荒漠上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "神秘的女性",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kaltsn07_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kaltsn07",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kaltsn07",
      "text": "他的事業，他的正義心，他的求知欲都抵達了終點。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "神秘的女性",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kaltsn07_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kaltsn07",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kaltsn07",
      "text": "我所知的那位索恩教授並非一位不諳世事的人，他坦誠地面對了自己的死亡，並在最後一刻都試圖抵抗。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "神秘的女性",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kaltsn07_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kaltsn07",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kaltsn07",
      "text": "艾利奧特，放下他吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾利奧特",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_171_1#11",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "神秘的女性",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kaltsn07_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kaltsn07",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kaltsn07",
      "text": "這是對逝者的尊重。你不會不明白，他難道希望自己成為你道路上的累贅嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾利奧特",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_171_1#11",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好吧......好吧......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "神秘的女性",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kaltsn07_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kaltsn07",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kaltsn07",
      "text": "（古老的瓦伊凡語言）願他的靈魂隨長河而歸。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾利奧特",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_171_1#11",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "瓦伊凡語......？你、你是瓦伊凡人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "神秘的女性",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kaltsn07_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kaltsn07",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kaltsn07",
      "text": "（古老的瓦伊凡語言）願他如砂礫般永恆寧靜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "神秘的女性",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kaltsn07_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kaltsn07",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kaltsn07",
      "text": "（古老的瓦伊凡語言）願他常聞故鄉耳語，願他在彼岸得見洪浪。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "神秘的女性",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kaltsn07_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kaltsn07",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kaltsn07",
      "text": "（古老的瓦伊凡語言）我們的朋友長眠於此。他將重歸浩瀚輪迴。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "女性低頭禱告，戰爭的炮火似乎也在此時暫歇。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾利奧特",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_171_1#11",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "神秘的女性",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kaltsn07_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kaltsn07",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kaltsn07",
      "text": "......時間不多，能做到的尊重到此為止。現在，你必須做出選擇。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
      "speakerToken": "npc_10002",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（警覺地低鳴）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "神秘的女性",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kaltsn07_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kaltsn07",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kaltsn07",
      "text": "是的，數量不少，但陣型凌亂鬆散，他們並非一支團結一心的武裝力量。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "神秘的女性",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kaltsn07_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kaltsn07",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kaltsn07",
      "text": "在遭遇我們之前，他們就會自取滅亡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾利奧特",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_171_1#11",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......我記起來了......我想起來在哪裡看過你這張臉了......很久之前......老師向我介紹過你......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾利奧特",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_171_1#11",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我還以為，你只是個理論研究員而已......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾利奧特",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_171_1#11",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我記得......你是叫......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾利奧特",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_171_1#11",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "凱爾希......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kaltsn07_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kaltsn07",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kaltsn07",
      "text": "嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kaltsn07_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kaltsn07",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kaltsn07",
      "text": "記性不差，艾利奧特。"
